__section

section__
  @title "Harrenhal Torchlit Census at the rookery"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-105.jpg"

  "Back at Harrenhal, your torchlit census lists whole villages as 'displaced' instead of taxed, a polite word for families living in ditches beside burned orchards. Edmure wants those families folded into formal relief rolls so rival houses cannot deny they exist. Sandor says rolls do not stop steel, and armed men are already pulling children from lines to ransom them back.

Hostage exchanges have replaced market days in half the Riverlands. Each delay means another body part in a courier satchel, another desperate lord willing to break oath for one more day with his heir alive. If you run this census publicly, you create accountability but reveal every weakness in your logistics. If you falsify the books to hide panic, you keep control now and plant the seeds of a larger revolt later.

Ravens crowd the rafters as scribes wait for your seal. Counting people has become deciding who is protected and who is expendable."

  choice__
    @target "Dragonstone Blood Price at first light"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Publish the Harrenhal relief census before sworn witnesses, lock hostage accounting into law, and accept the political fallout."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Blackwater Bay Sealed Bargain beneath lion seals"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Maintain two census ledgers, conceal true hostage totals, and use selective disclosure to keep rival houses obedient."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries"
    @when ((wealth + essos_ties + dragon_factor) >= 7)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action dragon_factor = clampStat(dragon_factor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
