section__
  @title "Dragonstone Blood Price at first light"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-106.jpg"

  "A Dragonstone collector arrives by river skiff with a revised levy: blood-price now includes houses that sheltered refugees without prior warrant. Arya calls it cruelty wrapped in seal wax. Beric notes that refusal will be framed as rebellion by whichever faction wins the next week in the capital.

Forged raven copies are already circulating, each with different totals, each engineered to make you look either weak or tyrannical. If you enforce the levy in daylight, you may stabilize rule of law while pushing civilians into starvation. If you skim or redirect collections in secret, you preserve lives today and risk total collapse of crown trust tomorrow.

The ferry deck shudders beneath sacks of damp grain and wounded men. One order from you decides whether taxation remains government or becomes banditry with paperwork."

  choice__
    @target "Blackwater Bay Sealed Bargain beneath lion seals"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Enforce the Dragonstone levy by public writ, document exemptions in open record, and bear the unrest that follows."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 7)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
