section__
  @title "Blackwater Bay Sealed Bargain beneath lion seals"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-107.jpg"

  "Blackwater agents return with a sealed bargain: they can reopen salt and lamp-oil shipments if Valehart grants priority docking to crown-affiliated merchants and 'forgets' several wartime seizures. Beric warns that signing rewards looters. Arya warns that without oil, the infirmary fires go dark before dawn.

Your quartermasters are now allocating food and medicine by route security, which means politics decides who receives treatment first. Sign openly and you may keep the sick alive while appearing captured by crown money. Sign in secret and you keep tactical flexibility while giving every rival reason to call you a liar when terms leak.

Storm wind rattles broken shutters as negotiators wait. This is less a trade pact than a choice about who controls the Riverlands' last functioning supply arteries."

  choice__
    @target "The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Table the Blackwater pact in open council, bind merchants to enforceable clauses, and absorb near-term disruption for legitimacy."
  __choice

