section__
  @title "The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-108.jpg"

  "Scouts report a Dreadfort muster drifting south under cover of refugee escorts, spears hidden beneath wool cloaks. Edmure wants to challenge them publicly before they cross deeper into Riverlands bridges. Sandor argues a public challenge only gives Bolton captains time to prepare legal excuses and sharper knives.

A key banner house now demands proof you can keep the roads secure before they release their reserve grain. If you move by strict writ and herald, you preserve the appearance of order while risking surprise raids. If you stage covert strikes against suspected infiltrators, you may prevent slaughter and still be branded a butcher by sunset gossip.

Rainwater pools in fresh graves while septas count new names. Frontier security and civilian confidence are now the same problem."

