section__
  @title "The Eyrie Crown Ultimatum by candle smoke"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-109.jpg"

  "Arryn stewards send a candle-smoked ultimatum: mountain toll waivers continue only if Riverlands caravans accept new inspection rights by Vale gates. Edmure hears extortion. Sandor hears opportunity, because inspections can also become choke points against enemy couriers.

Neutral houses hover, waiting to sell loyalty to whichever side guarantees safer passage this week. Accept the ultimatum publicly and you risk appearing subordinate to the Vale while preserving movement. Undermine it covertly and trade routes may freeze when frightened teamsters refuse the passes. Every wagon halted on paper is three villages hungry by nightfall.

Wax drips on the map as your clerks wait. This decree will decide whether the Riverlands remain a corridor or fracture into armed toll islands."

  choice__
