section__
  @title "Pentos Harbor Ambush in river fog"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-110.jpg"

  "Near a fogged river quay, your scouts uncover a Pentoshi ambush contract offering coin for each Valehart convoy burned before moon's turn. Arya wants immediate executions of captured middlemen. Beric insists some are coerced ferrymasters who can still map the full network.

Desertion climbs because your men believe raiders always know convoy timing. A public crackdown can restore confidence but may scare neutral boatmen into abandoning routes. A covert purge could dismantle the ambush ring faster while feeding rumors that Valehart disappears witnesses in the night. Either way, supply speed and political legitimacy are now tied to how you handle one wet dock and a handful of terrified prisoners.

Lantern light shakes on black water as interrogators await instruction. Delay means another burned wagon by dawn."

