section__
  @title "Qarth Alliance Split near the godswood"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-111.jpg"

  "Qartheen financiers arrive with polished contracts offering bridge repair teams, salted stores, and advance coin in exchange for collateral rights over seized farmlands. Beric says taking the money keeps civilians alive this month. Arya says selling future harvests to foreigners is surrender with better handwriting.

Refugee caravans choke both riverbanks, and hostage exchanges keep collapsing whenever one side runs out of food. Publicly accepting Qarth's terms may buy immediate stability but ignite backlash from houses already accusing you of foreign dependence. Refusing leaves you cleaner and poorer, with no guarantee the crossings hold through early frost.

The ferry ropes groan under overloaded carts while scribes copy clauses by torchlight. Your signature decides whether survival is funded by sovereignty or mortgaged against it."

  choice__
    @target "The Wall War Map against old law"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Submit the Qartheen contract to open levy vote, distribute terms transparently, and bind allies to a visible collective gamble."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Create a private financing channel with Qarth, hide collateral concessions, and gain liquidity while risking future backlash."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "The Wall War Map against old law"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-112.jpg"

  "A Wall dispatch reaches Riverlands command with maps marked in charcoal: raiding bands north of the Neck, garrisons underfed, watchtowers undermanned. Edmure argues the Riverlands cannot spare another cart. Sandor says if the Wall breaks, every argument about carts becomes a funeral list.

Ravens carrying edited fragments of the dispatch are already circulating, each version crafted to support one faction's panic or denial. Publicly committing aid south of your own crisis may steady long-term alliances and cripple short-term readiness. Quietly filtering aid through covert channels preserves flexibility while making your intent appear opportunistic.

Broken men warm their hands over damp fires outside your tent. The realm expects you to choose between nearby suffering and distant catastrophe, as if either can be ignored."

  choice__
    @target "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Issue a formal aid decree under old law, allocate men and grain openly, and accept immediate Riverlands strain for strategic duty."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 5)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Route support north through deniable intermediaries, preserve public reserves, and keep leverage by controlling information."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @when ((wealth + essos_ties + dragon_factor) >= 9)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action dragon_factor = clampStat(dragon_factor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Pay foreign river crews to move emergency stores north by night, buying speed with coin and external dependency."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-113.jpg"

  "At moonless camp near the Green Fork, a Watch rider produces a legal claim that Castle Black convoys can seize any Riverlands grain marked for frontier defense. Edmure says the claim is real but politically lethal in famine conditions. Sandor says legal disputes are meaningless if starving militias start cutting carts open on the road.

Your quartermasters now ration by route reliability, which means loyalty can be measured in sacks. Grant the claim publicly and you strengthen long-war survival while provoking near-term unrest. Contest it and you keep local peace for a week while weakening obligations the realm may need when winter fully sets in.

The night smells of wet canvas and turned soil from fresh graves. Your ruling will decide whether duty to distant walls outranks bread in nearby hands."

  choice__
    @target "Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Affirm the Castle Black claim in open decree, allocate guarded convoy shares, and protect lawful duty despite local anger."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Quietly narrow the claim through forged route exemptions, keep grain local, and retain leverage by controlling paperwork."
  __choice
