  @title "Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-115.jpg"

  "An Oldtown courier arrives under false sigils and confesses that certain maester channels are selling your relief-route schedules to raiders for hard coin. Beric wants the network exposed at once. Arya insists any leak in daylight will scatter the brokers before you can close the trap.

Neutral houses now demand payment before sharing their own scouts, citing repeated convoy hits as proof your command leaks like a cracked cask. A public purge could restore confidence if convictions are clear. A secret sweep could preserve momentum while deepening suspicion that legal process is theater. Either way, information security has become a food-security issue.

Burned wheat and lamp smoke hang over the floodplain. The next dispatch you authorize determines whether trust is rebuilt in court or enforced in shadows."

