  @title "Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-116.jpg"

  "A Pyke intermediary demands exchange terms for river hostages seized in 'independent raids' the Ironborn refuse to officially acknowledge. Edmure wants a lawful exchange before witnesses. Sandor says paying reavers with coin or prisoners invites ten more kidnappings before harvest.

Refugee escorts are deserting because they no longer trust command to protect noncombatants from capture. Public negotiations could steady morale if they succeed, yet failure in the open would shatter confidence. Covert recovery operations may free captives quickly while leaving your own men unsure which rules still apply.

The ferry timbers creak under chained prisoners and trembling families. You can buy order through law or through fear, but not both without cost."

