section__
  @title "Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-riverlands/frame-117.jpg"

  "Highgarden finally sends wagons, but only on condition their quartermasters supervise distribution and claim first share for allied cavalry. Edmure argues accepting helps everyone survive another fortnight. Sandor argues surrendering distribution control means surrendering political control of every town line.

Hostage politics are now intertwined with food drops: captors release prisoners only if their villages receive grain priority. Open acceptance of Highgarden terms may reduce immediate deaths while branding Valehart as dependent and weak. Secretly rerouting cargo keeps your authority intact and may trigger Tyrell retaliation when shortages expose the diversion.

Thunder rolls over smashed mills as both sides count barrels in the dark. These wagons carry bread, leverage, and the next round of accusations."

  choice__
    @target "Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
